[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2676341426","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103182#issuecomment-2676341426","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103182","id":2676341426,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fhbqy","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-22T18:31:27Z","updated_at":"2025-02-22T18:31:58Z","body":"> in the \"Shortcuts\" editor, I can't even press ctrl+shift+O in order to map it to something.\n\nYou mean you can't press the shortcut, or you can't change it to something else when you edit it?\n\nCan't reproduce, try testing in 4.4 rc1 too.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2676341426/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2676342837","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103182#issuecomment-2676342837","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103182","id":2676342837,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fhcA1","user":{"login":"sdepouw","id":4809334,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MDkzMzQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4809334?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdepouw","html_url":"https://github.com/sdepouw","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdepouw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdepouw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdepouw/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdepouw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdepouw/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdepouw/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdepouw/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdepouw/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdepouw/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-22T18:35:20Z","updated_at":"2025-02-22T18:35:20Z","body":"Thanks @KoBeWi but this issue was on my end / the operating system.\n\nI could edit the shortcut, but when it's listening for keys I found it couldn't detect it.\n\nWindows 10/11 (maybe others) was eating my keyboard shortcut. I found [this StackExchange answer](https://superuser.com/a/1455798/121722) which led to my solution.\n\nShort version, I set the \"Text Services and Input Languages\" Key Sequences to \"Not Assigned\" and everything worked. (They were set to `Ctrl + Shift` and `Left Alt + Shift`, respectively):\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c2cb008f-bbe0-4daf-a4e2-b0e89f077757)\n\nThanks Windows! Godot does not have the bug. Just happened to be the first program I used with that shortcut I guess.\n\nThe reason I thought my keyboards were good is that online testers were showing, at a guess \"key up\" but not \"key down\" or \"key press\" but still calling it detected. And of course I wouldn't detect this by changing keyboards because it was an OS level error.\n\nClosing the issue! But now I know how to file one properly should I run into something.\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2676342837/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]